.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-doctor - Run trading-readiness diagnostics


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets doctor [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Run the CLI's full trading-readiness preflight.

.PP
Checks configuration sanity, sandbox posture, public REST connectivity,
WebSocket reachability, authenticated API access, and rate-limit posture.

.PP
Use this command as the final bot/operator preflight before live execution.
For auth metadata only, use 'gemini-markets auth status'. For a live
authenticated probe only, use 'gemini-markets auth test'.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for doctor


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--no-websocket\fP[=false]
	disable WebSocket and use REST API only

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="json"
	output format: json, table, or csv

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	suppress stderr output for pure JSON piping

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	output compact JSON without pretty-printing

.PP
\fB--sandbox\fP[=false]
	use sandbox environment

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30
	request timeout in seconds

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	use full field names in JSON output (default: abbreviated)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gemini-markets doctor
  gemini-markets --sandbox doctor -q
  gemini-markets --no-websocket doctor -o table
.EE


